//        over a single low D; the drone returns after 'Pin back'.
//   s03  a small rising harp phrase after the first date ('2024'), the same phrase a step higher after the second
//        (the three-month rhyme); the race returns and is cut off on the shutter; the Tooth: a dry high pizzicato D
//        after 'click', a muffled low knock after 'thunk'; a warm cadence (Gm · Bbmaj7 → D) and T after 'say no'.
//   s04  the crane down: W in the harp (D C B-flat A); one soft harp A after 'witness'; a patient pizzicato count
